# 🌍 OUR MISSION

Explore hidden groundwater pathways beneath the oceans by bringing SAR satellite data together in an interactive, visual, and audio-enhanced web platform.

Through **AQUAVEIN-SAR**, we aim to transform complex satellite observations into accessible maps, visualizations, and sound-based experiences, helping people discover potential submarine groundwater discharge areas and better understand the invisible water systems beneath our planet.

By combining space technology, scientific research, and digital innovation, we strive to make the unseen visible, the complex understandable, and contribute to a more sustainable water future.

**We bring hidden waters to light through the power of space technology.**

